{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09897","headline":"和刑部成员外秋夜寓直寄台省知己 · 岑参","name":"和刑部成员外秋夜寓直寄台省知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"列宿光三署，仙郎直五宵。\n时衣天子赐，厨膳大官调。\n长乐钟应近，明光漏不遥。\n黄门持被覆，侍女捧香烧。\n笔爲题诗点，灯缘起草挑。\n竹喧交砌叶，柳嚲拂牕条。\n粉署荣新命，霜台忆旧僚。\n名香播兰蕙，重价蕴琼瑶。\n击水翻沧海，[抟]风透赤霄。\n微才喜同舍，何幸忽闻韶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09897.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09897","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}